    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∫</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>ln</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>&nbsp;(where,&nbsp;<math><mi>c</mi></math> is the constant of integration) and <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math> is equal to",
